{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "HOS",
  "chapter": 6,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Come, and let us return to the LORD: for he hath torn, and he will heal us; he hath smitten, and he will bind us up.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After two days will he revive us: in the third day will he raise us up, and we shall live in his sight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then shall we know, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " we follow on to know the LORD: his going forth is prepared as the morning; and he will come to us as the rain, as the latter ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " former rain to the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Ephraim, what shall I do to thee? O Judah, what shall I do to thee? for your goodness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the morning cloud, and as the early dew it goeth away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore have I hewed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the prophets; I have slain them by the words of my mouth: and thy judgments ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " goeth forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I desired mercy, and not sacrifice: and the knowledge of God more than burnt-offerings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But they like men have transgressed the covenant: there have they dealt treacherously against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Gilead ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a city of them that work iniquity, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " polluted with blood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And as troops of robbers wait for a man, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the company of priests murder in the way by consent: for they commit lewdness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have seen a horrible thing in the house of Israel: there ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the prostitution of Ephraim, Israel is defiled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HOS.6.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HOS.6.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also, O Judah, he hath set a harvest for thee, when I returned the captivity of my people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
